# ======================================================================
# What DOES get pushed (NOT ignored):
#   src/            - all pipeline source code
#   scripts/        - download + smoke-test helpers
#   report/         - deliverable figures (and REPORT.md at repo root)
#   README.md, requirements.txt, .gitignore
#   preprocessing.ipynb, load_data.py, *.pt, test_flux_predictions.csv,
#   "Solar Flare Iteration 3 (1).pdf"  (existing project files)
# Everything else is ignored below.
# ======================================================================

# --- Dataset (downloaded locally, never pushed) ---
data/

# --- Claude / agent tooling (local only, never pushed) ---
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
MEMORY.md
memory/
.claude-memory/

# --- Generated outputs / intermediate artifacts (regenerable) ---
artifacts/

# --- Temp sandbox from the smoke test ---
._smoke/

# --- Python caches / build ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- OS / editor junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
